    "text": "We say that a group is a Tarski monster if it is finitely generated, not cyclic,\nand all of its proper non-trivial subgroups are isomorphic to each other.\n   a) Do there exist amenable torsion-free Tarski monsters?\n   b) Do there exist amenable Tarski monsters of prime exponent?             D. Kielak",
